Regulation 1512&hyph;1; therefore, the Executive Order and Departmental Regulation do not apply to this action.

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
