 Pub. L. 94&hyph;582, 90 Stat. 2867, as amended (7 U.S.C. 71
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=21 g=1 f=3 -->
 et seq.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=21 g=1 f=1 -->
) 
