 The Office of Export Trading Company Affairs, International Trade Administration, Department of Commerce, has
received an application for an Export Trade Certificate of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Review. This notice summarizes the conduct for which certification is sought and requests comments relevant to whether
the Certificate should be issued. 
