<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=2 -->
SUPPLEMENTARY INFORMATION:
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
 Title III of the Export Trading 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Company Act of 1982 (15 U.S.C. 4001-21) authorizes the Secretary of Commerce to issue Export Trade Certificates of
Review. A Certificate of Review protects the holder and the members identified in the Certificate from state and federal
government antitrust actions and from private, treble damage antitrust 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
actions for the export conduct specified in the Certificate and carried out in compliance with its terms and conditions.
Section 302(b)(1) of the Act and 15 CFR 325.6(a) require the Secretary to publish a notice in the 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=4 -->
Federal Register
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
 identifying the applicant and summarizing its proposed export conduct. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=84 g=1 f=1 -->
Request for Public Comments 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
