should issue a Certificate to the applicant. An original and five (5) copies of such comments should be submitted no
later than 20 days after the date of this notice to: Office of Export Trading Company Affairs, International Trade
Administration, Department of Commerce, Room 1800H, Washington, D.C. 20230. Information submitted by any person
is exempt from disclosure under the Freedom of Information Act (5 U.S.C. 552). Comments should refer to this application
as ``Export Trade Certificate of Review, application number 94&hyph;00007.'' 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

