<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
To maintain up-to-date personnel security and suitability information for DMA civilians, military and applicant
personnel who require access to classified information; to determine and ensure continued eligibility for access
to classified information; to promote the efficiency of the service; and in the interests of National Security. This
includes all civilian, military and applicant personnel who occupy or may occupy sensitive positions without access,
and nonsensitive positions.
