<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=95 g=1 f=1 -->
Categories of individuals in the system:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
All military and civilian personnel assigned to, or employed by Headquarters, Defense Nuclear Agency, other U.S.
Government personnel, and U.S. Government contractors who elect to participate in the program.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=95 g=1 f=1 -->
Categories of records in the system:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Name of individual, home address and phone number, office phone number, working hours, map coordinate of home or nearby
reference points, and similar information. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=95 g=1 f=1 -->
Authority for maintenance of the system:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Federal Property and Administrative Service Act of 1949, 63 Stat. 377, as amended.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=95 g=1 f=1 -->
Purpose(s):
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
To assist members and applicants in contacting one another and provide printout of individuals in the system to other
participants who desire to arrange a carpool.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=95 g=1 f=1 -->
Routine uses of records maintained in the system, including categories of users and the purposes of such uses:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
In addition to those disclosures generally permitted under 5 U.S.C. 552a(b) of the Privacy Act, these records or information
contained therein may specifically be disclosed outside the DoD as a routine use pursuant to 5 U.S.C. 552a(b)(3) as
follows:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Information may be disclosed to the states of Maryland, Virginia, and the District of Columbia for inclusion in their
Ridesharing Programs.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
The `Blanket Routine Uses' published at the beginning of DNA's compilation of systems of records notices apply to
this system.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=95 g=1 f=1 -->
Policies and practices for storing, retrieving, accessing, retaining, and disposing of records in the system:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Storage:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Computer magnetic tapes, disks, and paper printouts, and manual storage within self-help carpool locator board.

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=95 g=1 f=1 -->
Retrievability:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Information is accessed and retrieved by name and home address map grid for automated system. Information is manually
accessed and retrieved from cards in map grids for locator board.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=95 g=1 f=1 -->
Safeguards:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
All participants have access to the data. The computer terminals are located in restricted areas accessible only
to authorized personnel. Buildings are protected by security guards and an intrusion alarm system. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=95 g=1 f=1 -->
Retention and disposal:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Data is retained only on active participants; destroyed upon request or reassignment.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=95 g=1 f=1 -->
System manager(s) and address:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Office of Logistics and Engineering, Headquarters, Defense Nuclear Agency, 6801 Telegraph Road, Alexandria, VA
22310&hyph;3398.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=95 g=1 f=1 -->
Notification procedure:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Individuals seeking to determine whether information about themselves is contained in this system should address
written inquiries to the Office of Logistics and Engineering, Headquarters, Defense Nuclear Agency, 6801 Telegraph
Road, Alexandria, VA 22310&hyph;3398.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=95 g=1 f=1 -->
Record access procedures:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Individuals seeking access to information about themselves contained in this system should address written inquiries
to the Logistics Division, Office of Logistics and Engineering, Headquarters, Defense Nuclear Agency, 6801 Telegraph
Road, Alexandria, VA 22310&hyph;3398.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Individuals should provide name, current address, and sufficient information to permit locating the record.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
For personal visits, the individual should provide military or civilian identification card.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=95 g=1 f=1 -->
Contesting record procedures:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
The DNA rules for accessing records, and for contesting contents and appealing initial agency determinations are
published in DNA Instruction 5400.11A; 32 CFR part 318; or may be obtained from the system manager or the General Counsel,
Headquarters, Defense Nuclear Agency, 6801 Telegraph Road, Alexandria, VA 22310&hyph;3398.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=95 g=1 f=1 -->
Record source categories:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
From the individual.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=95 g=1 f=1 -->
Exemptions claimed for the system:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
None. 
