SUPPLEMENTARY INFORMATION: 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=3 -->
Purpose of the Task Force: 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
The Secretary of Energy Advisory Board Task Force on Strategic Energy Research and Development will assist the Board
in its top-level review of the Department's civilian energy research programs. The Board's Task Force will examine
the Department's current research and development (R&amp;D) portfolio against its strategic goals policy priorities
and national needs; the Departments research and development planning and management process; and the first research,
development, demonstration, and commercialization management plan, required biennially by the Energy Policy
Act of 1992. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

