<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
, Inc., St. Louis, Missouri; to acquire 100 percent of the voting shares of Central Mortgage Bancshares, Inc., Kansas
City, Missouri, and thereby indirectly acquire Citizens Bank of Southwest Missouri, Nevada, Missouri; Citizens-Jackson
County Bank, Warrensburg, Missouri; and Farmers Bank of Stover, Stover, Missouri.
