<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
The Miller Creek area would be designated an area of critical environmental concern to maintain, protect, and/or
restore natural processes, wildlife, and scenic values. The area would not be available to planned timber harvest.
Livestock grazing would be restricted. Mineral leasing would be subject to no surface occupancy. The area would be
closed to off-highway vehicle use (except Round Valley Road area). 
