<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Institution of injunctive actions.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Institution of administrative proceedings of an enforcement nature. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Opinion.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG QTAG 04 -->
<!-- PJG /QTAG -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
At times, changes in Commission priorities require alternations in the scheduling of meeting items. For further
information and to ascertain what, if any, matters have been added, deleted or postponed, please contact: The Office
of the Secretary (202) 942&hyph;7070.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG QTAG 04 -->
