<SUMMARY>
<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=2 -->
SUMMARY:
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
 The Federal Emergency Management Agency (FEMA or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Agency) gives notice of the State contacts for the Hotel and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Motel Fire Safety Act national master list, current as of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
November 18, 1994. The offices or officials listed are 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
responsible for compiling the respective State listings of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
properties which comply with the Hotel and Motel Fire Safety 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Act, and should be contacted directly for any changes to the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
national master list. 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG QTAG 02 -->
<!-- PJG /QTAG -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
</SUMMARY>
