<SUPPLEM>
<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=2 -->
SUPPLEMENTARY INFORMATION:
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
 Acting under the Hotel and Motel Fire Safety Act of 1990, 15 U.S.C. 2201 note, the United 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
States Fire Administration has worked with each State to 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
compile a national master list of all of the places of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
public accommodation affecting commerce located in each 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
State that meet the requirements of the guidelines under the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Act. FEMA published the national master list in the 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=4 -->
Federal 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Register
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
 on Tuesday, November 24, 1992, 57 FR 55314, and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
makes periodic changes to the list. The national master 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
list is being republished today as a separate part in the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=4 -->
Federal Register
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Separately FEMA published lists of State contacts in 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
58 FR 17020 on March 31, 1993 and in 59 FR 50132 on 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
September 30, 1994. Today's list of State contacts is 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
published to coincide with publication of the November 1994 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
national master, and is current as of November 18, 1994. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Each State and Territory or other participating 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
jurisdiction is responsible for compiling its respective 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
listings of properties which comply with the Hotel and Motel 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Fire Safety Act. If you own or represent a property in 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
compliance with the Act, and want to include the property in 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the national master list or to make an addition, deletion, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
or other change to a listing on the national master list, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
please contact the appropriate office in the State or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
jurisdiction where the property is located. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Copies of the national master list and its updates may 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
be obtained by writing to the Government Printing Office, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Superintendent of Documents, Washington, DC 20402&hyph;9325. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
When requesting copies please refer to stock number 069&hyph;001- 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
00049&hyph;1. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
The State contacts for the national master list follow 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
below. 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG QTAG 04 -->
<!-- PJG /QTAG -->

