<!-- PJG STAG 4703 -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
(ii) The content of the proposed technical assistance and instructional approach are appropriate for the project
participants. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(3) The Secretary determines the extent to which each application provides for_
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(i) A method for gaining the participation of prospective target populations in need of technical assistance; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(ii) Innovative procedures for disseminating information and imparting skills to project participants; and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(iii) Use of current research finding and information on model practices in providing the technical assistance.

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

